way another staircase climbs upward, and another hole in the floor appears ahead, mirroring the opening. No people, only quiet, looping, impossible architecture.\n\noverall_soundscape: N/A\nnon_diegetic_music:  N/A",1344,768,5,992337134417925,"minimax_h3/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_w6a8.safetensors","minimax_h3/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors","minimax_h3/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors","minimax_h3/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors"],"widgets_values_named":{"prompt":"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Photorealistic, live-action, one continuous take, vertical 9:16. A first-person FPV drone POV gliding at waist height through an impossible, endlessly continuing interior. \n Camera motion: smooth continuous FPV glide, medium speed, with fluid banking turns and gentle tilts, no cuts.\n\nThe shot opens flying low over a large hole cut cleanly into the floor, revealing a furnished room on the level below. The drone continues toward a short staircase with railings leading up to a raised landing, then banks tightly around the banister and emerges into a vast open hall. The hall is layered and three-dimensional: floating mezzanine balconies hover at different heights, staircases climb up into dark openings in the ceiling, and openings in the ceiling reveal the underside of floors above. A single out-of-place everyday object stands alone against a wall. The drone glides beneath a balcony, tilts up to look at a ceiling opening directly overhead, then levels out and continues into a long hallway with open doorways on both sides. At the end of the hallway another staircase climbs upward, and another hole in the floor appears ahead, mirroring the opening. No people, only quiet, looping, impossible architecture.\n\noverall_soundscape: N/A\nnon_diegetic_music:  N/A","width":1344,"height":768,"value_1":5,"noise_seed":992337134417925,"unet_name":"minimax_h3/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_w6a8.safetensors","clip_name":"minimax_h3/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_n